    "id": "what-do-we-know-about-nvidia-ceo-s-affai-e7e00f67",
    "title": "What do we know about Nvidia CEO’s affair with a suspected Chinese spy?",
    "titleJa": "What do we know about Nvidia CEO’s affair with a suspected Chinese spy?",
    "summaryJa": "Adoration for the US tech giant’s CEO Jensen Huang has been labelled “Jensanity”, but can his reputation survive the news of his affair?",
    "bodyOriginal": "What do we know about Nvidia CEO’s affair with a suspected Chinese spy?\nUS tech giant Nvidia has opened an independent investigation following reports its boss Jensen Huang had a relationship with businesswoman Alice Huang, a suspected Chinese spy.\nHuang has been in charge of the tech giant for 30 years, and is a popular public figure - but will this scandal hurt his reputation? The BBC’s Steve Lai explains everything you need to know.",
    "bodyJa": "What do we know about Nvidia CEO’s affair with a suspected Chinese spy?\nUS tech giant Nvidia has opened an independent investigation following reports its boss Jensen Huang had a relationship with businesswoman Alice Huang, a suspected Chinese spy.\nHuang has been in charge of the tech giant for 30 years, and is a popular public figure - but will this scandal hurt his reputation? The BBC’s Steve Lai explains everything you need to know.",
    "source": "BBC",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cq3989nkzn3ko?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T07:10:11+00:00",
    "category": "テクノロジー",
    "imageUrl": "https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/83e2/live/f1cb1e30-dc24-11f1-93e1-3b657b665bcf.png",
